==French==

===Verb===

[[avoir]] [[le]] [[cafard]]

# to have the [[blues]]

[[Category:French idioms]]

This term originated from Algeria?Marrocco when they were French colonies where members of the French Foreigh Legion suffered extreme boredom in their stockades and took to shooting beetles ( les cafards) with their rifles. Le cafard came to mean an extreme depression or sense of pointlessness.

[[fr:avoir le cafard]]